plugin-hostd (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Pin a plugin's binary and layout before add admits it (pin_set,
    pin_clear, pin_expect).
  * Read every verb from its declaration.
  * Give a pinned LV2 plugin a worker of its own, fail an add whose
    pin_expect goes unanswered, and announce a refused replay.

